From f890a426a73f7af64b62774b4277dcffd701b5d9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ashfordeOU <236818772+ashfordeOU@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 17:43:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] i18n: the ephem-export usage line in the 17 translated
 engine-main-usage messages (C7-1 added it to the English message only, so
 tools/i18n.mjs check failed on every language: string-literal placeables
 differ)

---
